    "body": "Triage (agent-set): bug, P3, area:3d, effort:high.\nP3: legal output, wrong behaviour a user hits - the path is valid but churns retract/plunge at every lid step edge; workaround: avoid stepped lids or accept the churn. Not P1 - nothing gouging posts (verify's lane unchanged).\neffort:high: safety floor (toolpath geometry) over the existing land-model mechanism - closing/emit heights and a lateral bridge, not a new algorithm from literature, so not max.\n",
